# Benchmark run output: append-only JSONL plus per-run captured text. It is data produced
# by spending API budget, not source, and it is regenerated by re-running the harness.

# This repo dogfoods the kit, so .claude/ is assembled by `pnpm dogfood` and is not source.
# `.claude/ledgers/` is the exception: it holds the append-only ledgers behind DECISIONS.md
# and BACKLOG.md, and losing them loses every recorded entry. `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`,
# because git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is itself excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/ledgers/
